# Repo structure (SSOT)

Machine paths and doc names: `workspace.config.json`.

## Layout (single Next.js app at repo root)

| Area | Path | Role |
|------|------|------|
| App | `src/app/` | Next.js App Router pages and API routes |
| Components | `src/components/` | UI and layout |
| Content | `src/content/blog/` | Published MDX articles |
| Content lib | `src/lib/content/` | Schema, loaders, images |
| SEO | `src/lib/seo/` | JSON-LD, metadata helpers |
| Public assets | `public/images/` | Blog, home, shared images (unique per slot) |
| Scripts | `scripts/` | Build, content pipeline, tools |
| Content SEO Kit | `.content-kit/` | Pipeline template (sync via `scripts/content-kit-sync.mjs`) |
| Agent stack | `.cursor/rules/`, `.cursor/agents/`, `.cursor/skills/`, `.commends/` | Rules, agents, workflows |
| Notes | `notes/implementations/`, `notes/sessions/` | Briefs, checklist, scope state |
| ADR | `ADR/` | Architecture decisions |
| Owner workfiles | `OWNER-REPORTS/` | Non-authoritative session notes |

## Product SSOT

- `SSOT.md` (`workspace.config.json` → `productSsotDoc`)
- `AGENTS.md` — agent-facing stack summary
- `PROJECT_USER_JOURNEY_STEPS.md` (`journeyDoc`) when present
- `SETUP-INSTRUCTIONS.md` (`setupInstructionsDoc`) when present

## Agent workspace (agentic-workspace-template)

- **Scope-list loops**: skills `scope-list-implementation-loop`, `scope-list-delegation-parallel`
- **Orchestration agents**: `scope-orchestrator`, `scope-worker`, `rca-scope`, `review-scope`, `scope-loop-runner`
- **State schemas**: `notes/implementations/scope_loop_state.example.json`, `scope_dag.example.json`
- **`task_graph.log`** at repo root — append-only OOST
- **Git hooks**: `scripts/git-hooks/` (pre-commit disabled per owner request)

## Content SEO Kit (project-specific)

- Profile SSOT: `content-pipeline.profile.json`
- Rules: `content-kit-commends-todo.mdc`, `content-seo-quality.mdc`, `unique-site-images.mdc`
- Skill: `.cursor/skills/content-seo-pipeline/SKILL.md`

## Scope lists

- Primary: `notes/TODO_checklist_full_scopes_*.txt` (see `notes/TODO_checklist_full_scopes.example.txt`)
- Spike-driven: `OWNER-REPORTS/*_spike_audit.md` → `## Scopes` section

## Deploy and dev

- Vercel (`vercel.json`); production `https://avniguy.co.il`
- Dev server: `pnpm run dev` → **http://localhost:3001/**
